{"sha": "31b730bb8e64c35141a4d4605458a08b5ecf6656107147b0c95484753dfeec2c", "body": ["\\chapter{加法和减法}\\label{ch:g3:addsub}", "", "加法表示把数合在一起，减法表示去掉一部分，或", "求出缺少的部分。本章训练两种竖式方法", "--- 包括著名的进位和退位 --- 以及", "常常让竖式变得不必要的口算技巧。", "", "\\section{竖式加法}", "", "\\begin{method}[竖式加法]\\label{met:g3:addsub:add}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 把各数上下写齐，个位对个位，", "        十位对十位（\\emph{右对齐}）；", "  \\item 个位相加；若和超过 $9$，则写下和的个位数字，", "        并将一个十\\emph{进位}到下一列（写作小 $1$）；", "  \\item 继续对十位、百位、\\dots 逐位相加，", "        每次都要加上进位数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g3:addsub:add}", "计算 $457 + 368$：", "\\[", "\\begin{array}{r}", "{\\scriptstyle 1}\\ \\ {\\scriptstyle 1}\\ \\ \\phantom{0} \\\\[-3pt]", "4\\,5\\,7 \\\\", "+\\ 3\\,6\\,8 \\\\", "\\hline", "8\\,2\\,5", "\\end{array}", "\\]", "个位：$7 + 8 = 15$，写下 $5$，进 $1$。十位：", "$5 + 6 + 1 = 12$，写下 $2$，进 $1$。百位：$4 + 3 + 1 = 8$。", "结果为 $825$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[口算加法]\\label{ex:g3:addsub:mental}", "在列竖式之前，先找一找好算的数：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\emph{凑十}：$47 + 8 = 47 + 3 + 5 = 50 + 5 = 55$；", "  \\item \\emph{分步跳算}：$256 + 130 = 256 + 100 + 30 = 386$；", "  \\item \\emph{调换顺序}：$17 + 59 + 3 = (17 + 3) + 59 = 79$。", "\\end{itemize}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.2,0) -- (10.4,0);", "  \\foreach \\x/\\l in {0.56/{256}, 5.56/{356}, 7.06/{386}}", "    { \\draw (\\x,-0.08) -- (\\x,0.08);", "      \\node[below, font=\\small] at (\\x,-0.1) {$\\l$}; }", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, thick] (0.56,0.25) .. controls (2.8,1.15) ..", "    (5.56,0.25);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (3.05,1.05) {$+100$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (5.56,0.25) .. controls (6.3,0.8) ..", "    (7.06,0.25);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (6.3,0.85) {$+30$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 用数轴上的跳跃表示口算加法：$256 + 130$ 分两次", "跳完，先加百位，再加十位。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{竖式减法}", "", "\\begin{method}[竖式减法]\\label{met:g3:addsub:sub}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 把较大的数写在上面，右端对齐；", "  \\item 从个位开始，逐位相减；", "  \\item 若上方数字不够减，就 \\emph{退位}：从上一行的高一位借一个，", "        它在当前列相当于十，", "        计入当前列；", "  \\item \\emph{验算}：差加上减数", "        应等于上方的数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g3:addsub:sub}", "计算 $603 - 147$：", "\\[", "\\begin{array}{r}", "6\\,0\\,3 \\\\", "-\\ 1\\,4\\,7 \\\\", "\\hline", "4\\,5\\,6", "\\end{array}", "\\]", "个位：$3 - 7$ 不够减，需要连续退位：$603$ 变为", "$5$ 个百、$9$ 个十、$13$ 个一。然后 $13 - 7 = 6$；", "十位 $9 - 4 = 5$；百位 $5 - 1 = 4$。结果为 $456$。", "验算：$456 + 147 = 603$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.82]", "  % before: 6 hundreds, 0 tens, 3 units", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.5,2.25) {$603$ 退位前};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5}", "    \\draw[omProp, fill=omProp!25] (0.62*\\i,0.7) rectangle", "      (0.62*\\i+0.44,1.7);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.7,0.55) {$6$ 个百};", "  \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (4.35,1.2) {$0$ 个十};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2} \\fill[omDef] (5.4+0.4*\\i,1.2) circle (0.13);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (5.8,0.55) {$3$ 个一};", "  % after: 5 hundreds, 9 tens, 13 units", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-3.3cm]", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.5,2.25) {$603$ 退位后};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,4}", "    \\draw[omProp, fill=omProp!25] (0.62*\\i,0.7) rectangle", "      (0.62*\\i+0.44,1.7);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.4,0.55) {$5$ 个百};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,8}", "    \\draw[omThm, very thick] (3.5+0.22*\\i,0.7) -- (3.5+0.22*\\i,1.7);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (4.4,0.55) {$9$ 个十};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,6} \\fill[omDef] (6.1+0.4*\\i,1.45) circle (0.13);", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,...,5} \\fill[omDef] (6.1+0.4*\\i,0.95) circle (0.13);", "  \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (7.3,0.55) {$13$ 个一};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}